{"publicId":"ae4328ec-63b2-4554-8197-b722b714332d","title":"Sclerosis期刊正式被ESCI收录","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:42.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:42.000Z","digest":"MDPI将Sclerosis期刊纳入ESCI收录范围，标志着该期刊获得国际学术数据库的正式认可。该期刊聚焦多发性硬化症、系统性硬化症等硬化性疾病研究，内容涵盖基础医学与临床实践。据MDPI官方披露，截至2026年11月，其旗下554个期刊中已有259个被ESCI收录，此次新增为其中之一。\n\nESCI收录通常被视为期刊进入国际学术评价体系的重要一步，但需注意其与SCI、SCIE等数据库的等级差异。Sclerosis期刊此前未被ESCI收录，具体评估标准未公开披露。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T12:39:02.373Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Sclerosis 期刊正式被ESCI收录","latestReport":{"id":"jm7wmk5qe6p3jpxwfid5b4r7z"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f8N5GiejwtV4","title":"Sclerosis 期刊正式被ESCI收录","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:42.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"jm7wmk5qe6p3jpxwfid5b4r7z","title":"Sclerosis 期刊正式被ESCI收录","summary":"MDPI期刊 Sclerosis 正式被ESCI (Web of Science) 收录。该期刊内容涵盖多发性硬化症、系统性硬化症等多种硬化性疾病，旨在为科研成果和临床实践提供学术交流平台。目前，MDPI已出版554个期刊，其中ESCI期刊259个。","source":{"name":"科学网博客","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:42.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"jm7wmk5qe6p3jpxwfid5b4r7z","title":"Sclerosis 期刊正式被ESCI收录","summary":"MDPI期刊 Sclerosis 正式被ESCI (Web of Science) 收录。该期刊内容涵盖多发性硬化症、系统性硬化症等多种硬化性疾病，旨在为科研成果和临床实践提供学术交流平台。目前，MDPI已出版554个期刊，其中ESCI期刊259个。","source":{"name":"科学网博客","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T06:35:42.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":6.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-